          "previewAudio": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/mindful-mr-sloth-and-waiting-on-mr-sloth.mp3",
          "description": "Sasha has one speed—fast. She loves to do lots of things, all at once, as fast as possible. Mr. Sloth has one speed—slow. He loves to do things one at a time, at a nice, easy pace. Can Mr. Sloth’s mindful ways teach Sasha to slow down and enjoy life? \n\nBest-selling author Katy Hudson gently weaves a mindfulness theme into this unlikely friendship tale between an energetic girl and a sloth, encouraging children to stop, breathe, and be present in every moment.",
